<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Tallah/Goldie Case: Complete Investigation Documentation</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Cinzel:wght@400;600;700&display=swap');

        body {
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            background: #F8F4F0;
            color: #800020;
            line-height: 1.6;
            position: relative;
            print-color-adjust: exact;
            -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
        }

        /* Royal ornate pattern background */
        body::before {
            content: '';
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="120" height="120" viewBox="0 0 120 120"><g fill="none" stroke="rgba(232,180,160,0.12)" stroke-width="1"><circle cx="60" cy="60" r="30"/><path d="M30,60 Q45,30 60,60 Q75,90 90,60 Q75,30 60,60 Q45,90 30,60"/><circle cx="60" cy="60" r="15" fill="rgba(155,124,182,0.08)"/><path d="M60,45 L65,50 L60,55 L55,50 Z" fill="rgba(232,180,160,0.15)"/></g></svg>') repeat;
            z-index: -1;
            opacity: 0.6;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        /* Formal Header without gradients */
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
            padding: 40px;
            background: #F8F4F0;
            border: 3px solid #E8B4A0;
            border-radius: 15px;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        /* SVG-based royal ornate trim */
        .header::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -3px;
            left: -3px;
            right: -3px;
            bottom: -3px;
            background: url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none"><defs><linearGradient id="royalShimmer" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="0%"><stop offset="0%" style="stop-color:rgba(232,180,160,0.3);stop-opacity:0"/><stop offset="30%" style="stop-color:rgba(232,180,160,0.8);stop-opacity:1"/><stop offset="50%" style="stop-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);stop-opacity:1"/><stop offset="70%" style="stop-color:rgba(232,180,160,0.8);stop-opacity:1"/><stop offset="100%" style="stop-color:rgba(232,180,160,0.3);stop-opacity:0"/></linearGradient></defs><rect x="0" y="0" width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(%23royalShimmer)"/></svg>') no-repeat;
            background-size: 200% 100%;
            border-radius: 15px;
            z-index: -1;
            animation: royalShimmer 3s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        @keyframes royalShimmer {
            0% { background-position: -200% 0; }
            100% { background-position: 200% 0; }
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-size: 2.8em;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            color: #800020;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-family: 'Amiri', serif;
        }

        .header .subtitle {
            font-size: 1.3em;
            color: #9B7CB6;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .header .case-details {
            font-size: 1.1em;
            color: #B8966C;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        /* Navigation Menu */
        .nav-menu {
            background: rgba(248,244,240,0.95);
            border: 2px solid #E8B4A0;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .nav-menu h3 {
            color: #800020;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-family: 'Amiri', serif;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 30px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .nav-link {
            color: #9B7CB6;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 8px 15px;
            border: 1px solid #E8B4A0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .nav-link:hover {
            background: #E8B4A0;
            color: #800020;
        }

        /* Section Organization */
        .section {
            margin: 60px 0;
            padding: 40px;
            background: rgba(248,244,240,0.98);
            border: 2px solid #E8B4A0;
            border-radius: 20px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .section-header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #E8B4A0;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 2.4em;
            color: #800020;
            font-family: 'Amiri', serif;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .section-description {
            font-size: 1.2em;
            color: #9B7CB6;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        /* Timeline Styles */
        .timeline {
            position: relative;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 30px 0;
        }

        .timeline::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: 50%;
            top: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            width: 6px;
            background: #E8B4A0;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(232,180,160,0.4);
            border-radius: 3px;
        }

        .day-section {
            margin-bottom: 80px;
        }

        .day-header {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 1.8em;
            color: #800020;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            padding: 20px;
            background: #F8F4F0;
            border: 2px solid #E8B4A0;
            border-radius: 15px;
            font-family: 'Amiri', serif;
        }

        .event {
            position: relative;
            width: 45%;
            padding: 25px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            background: #F8F4F0;
            border-radius: 15px;
            border: 2px solid rgba(232,180,160,0.6);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(128,0,32,0.15);
            transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
            cursor: pointer;
            overflow: visible;
        }

        .event:hover {
            transform: translateY(-8px) scale(1.02);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(128,0,32,0.25);
            border-color: #E8B4A0;
        }

        .event.left {
            left: 0;
        }

        .event.right {
            left: 55%;
        }

        /* Formalized Hexagonal Interaction System */
        .hex-button {
            position: absolute;
            top: 30px;
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .hex-main {
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            background: #E8B4A0;
            clip-path: polygon(25% 6.7%, 75% 6.7%, 100% 50%, 75% 93.3%, 25% 93.3%, 0% 50%);
            position: relative;
            z-index: 10;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(232,180,160,0.6);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .event.left .hex-button {
            right: -75px;
        }

        .event.right .hex-button {
            left: -75px;
        }

        .hex-satellites {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            opacity: 0;
            transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .hex-satellite {
            position: absolute;
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            background: rgba(155,124,182,0.7);
            clip-path: polygon(25% 6.7%, 75% 6.7%, 100% 50%, 75% 93.3%, 25% 93.3%, 0% 50%);
            animation: satellitePulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .event:hover .hex-satellites {
            opacity: 1;
        }

        .event:hover .hex-main {
            transform: scale(1.3);
            box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(232,180,160,1);
            animation: hexPulse 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        /* Satellite positioning - 6 points around main hex */
        .hex-satellite:nth-child(1) { top: -25px; left: 15px; animation-delay: 0s; }
        .hex-satellite:nth-child(2) { top: -12px; left: 35px; animation-delay: 0.2s; }
        .hex-satellite:nth-child(3) { top: 12px; left: 35px; animation-delay: 0.4s; }
        .hex-satellite:nth-child(4) { top: 25px; left: 15px; animation-delay: 0.6s; }
        .hex-satellite:nth-child(5) { top: 12px; left: -5px; animation-delay: 0.8s; }
        .hex-satellite:nth-child(6) { top: -12px; left: -5px; animation-delay: 1s; }

        @keyframes hexPulse {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(1.3); opacity: 1; }
            50% { transform: scale(1.5); opacity: 0.8; }
        }

        @keyframes satellitePulse {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(0.8); opacity: 0.6; }
            50% { transform: scale(1.2); opacity: 1; }
        }

        /* Event Type Classifications */
        .event.critical .hex-main {
            background: #800020;
            animation: criticalAlert 1s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
        }

        .event.legal .hex-main {
            background: #9B7CB6;
        }

        .event.communication .hex-main {
            background: #B8D4F1;
        }

        .event.medical .hex-main {
            background: #B8966C;
        }

        @keyframes criticalAlert {
            0% { box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(128,0,32,0.6); }
            100% { box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(128,0,32,1); }
        }

        .event-time {
            font-size: 1em;
            color: #E8B4A0;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .event-title {
            font-size: 1.4em;
            color: #800020;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-family: 'Amiri', serif;
        }

        .event-description {
            color: #9B7CB6;
            font-size: 1em;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .source-citation {
            font-size: 0.85em;
            color: #B8966C;
            font-style: italic;
            margin-top: 10px;
            padding-top: 8px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(232,180,160,0.4);
        }

        .response-indicator {
            position: absolute;
            top: 12px;
            right: 12px;
            width: 20px;
            height: 20px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 2px solid #F8F4F0;
        }

        .response-positive { background: #9B7CB6; }
        .response-negative { background: #800020; }
        .response-none { background: #B8966C; }

        /* Contact Graph Network */
        .contact-network {
            margin: 40px 0;
            padding: 30px;
            background: rgba(248,244,240,0.95);
            border: 2px solid #E8B4A0;
            border-radius: 15px;
        }

        .network-svg {
            width: 100%;
            height: 600px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(232,180,160,0.3);
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        /* Escalation Timeline */
        .escalation-timeline {
            margin: 40px 0;
        }

        .escalation-flow {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 15px;
        }

        .escalation-item {
            background: rgba(248,244,240,0.9);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            border-left: 5px solid #E8B4A0;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .escalation-item:hover {
            transform: translateX(8px);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(128,0,32,0.15);
        }

        .escalation-date {
            color: #800020;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-family: 'Amiri', serif;
            margin-right: 15px;
        }

        .escalation-critical {
            border-left-color: #800020;
            background: rgba(128,0,32,0.05);
        }

        /* Contact Details Modal */
        .contact-popup {
            position: fixed;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            background: #F8F4F0;
            border: 3px solid #E8B4A0;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 35px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 50px rgba(232,180,160,0.8);
            z-index: 1000;
            display: none;
            max-width: 600px;
            width: 90%;
            max-height: 80vh;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }

        .contact-popup.active {
            display: block;
            animation: modalAppear 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.275);
        }

        @keyframes modalAppear {
            0% { opacity: 0; transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(0.8); }
            100% { opacity: 1; transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1); }
        }

        .contact-popup .close-btn {
            position: absolute;
            top: 12px;
            right: 18px;
            background: none;
            border: none;
            font-size: 24px;
            color: #E8B4A0;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .contact-popup .close-btn:hover {
            transform: scale(1.2);
            color: #800020;
        }

        .popup-overlay {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: rgba(128,0,32,0.4);
            z-index: 999;
            display: none;
            backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
        }

        .popup-overlay.active {
            display: block;
        }

        /* Contact Information Styling */
        .contact-name {
            font-size: 1.5em;
            color: #800020;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-family: 'Amiri', serif;
        }

        .contact-email, .contact-phone, .contact-role {
            color: #9B7CB6;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 1.1em;
        }

        .contact-email { color: #B8D4F1; }

        .contact-notes {
            background: rgba(155,124,182,0.1);
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border-left: 4px solid #9B7CB6;
            margin-top: 12px;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #9B7CB6;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .event-context {
            color: #800020;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            font-family: 'Amiri', serif;
        }

        .contact-details-item {
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            padding: 15px;
            background: rgba(240,234,230,0.6);
            border-radius: 10px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(232,180,160,0.4);
        }

        /* Participants Grid */
        .participants-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
            gap: 25px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .participant-card {
            background: #F8F4F0;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            border: 2px solid rgba(232,180,160,0.5);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .participant-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(128,0,32,0.15);
            border-color: #E8B4A0;
        }

        .participant-name {
            font-size: 1.2em;
            color: #800020;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-family: 'Amiri', serif;
        }

        .participant-role {
            color: #9B7CB6;
            font-size: 1em;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .participant-email {
            color: #B8D4F1;
            font-size: 0.95em;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        /* Response Flow Analysis Styles */
        .response-container {
            position: relative;
            margin: 30px 0;
            padding: 20px;
            background: rgba(248,244,240,0.8);
            border-radius: 15px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(232,180,160,0.4);
        }

        .zoom-controls {
            position: absolute;
            top: 15px;
            right: 15px;
            background: rgba(128,0,32,0.8);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 10px;
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .zoom-btn {
            background: #E8B4A0;
            color: #800020;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 8px 12px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .zoom-btn:hover {
            background: #800020;
            color: #F8F4F0;
        }

        .response-svg {
            width: 100%;
            height: 700px;
            border: 2px solid rgba(232,180,160,0.4);
            border-radius: 10px;
            cursor: grab;
        }

        .response-svg:active {
            cursor: grabbing;
        }

        /* Rolodex Table Styles */
        .rolodex-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin-top: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(128,0,32,0.1);
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .rolodex-table th {
            background: #800020;
            color: #F8F4F0;
            padding: 15px;
            text-align: left;
            font-family: 'Amiri', serif;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .rolodex-table td {
            padding: 12px 15px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(232,180,160,0.3);
        }

        .rolodex-table tr:nth-child(even) {
            background: rgba(232,180,160,0.1);
        }

        .rolodex-table tr:hover {
            background: rgba(232,180,160,0.2);
        }

        .category-individual {
            border-left: 4px solid #9B7CB6;
        }

        .category-institution {
            border-left: 4px solid #B8D4F1;
        }

        .category-legal {
            border-left: 4px solid #800020;
        }

        .category-organization {
            border-left: 4px solid #B8966C;
        }

        /* Strategic Notes Section */
        .strategic-notes {
            background: rgba(155,124,182,0.05);
            border-radius: 15px;
            padding: 25px;
            margin-top: 30px;
            border-left: 5px solid #9B7CB6;
        }

        .strategic-notes h3 {
            color: #800020;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-family: 'Amiri', serif;
        }

        .strategic-notes ul {
            padding-left: 20px;
        }

        .strategic-notes li {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: #9B7CB6;
        }

        /* Print Styles */
        @media print {
            body {
                background: white;
                color: black;
            }
            
            .nav-menu, .zoom-controls {
                display: none;
            }
            
            .section {
                break-inside: avoid;
                border: 1px solid #ccc;
            }
            
            .event:hover {
                transform: none;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .timeline::before { left: 30px; }
            .event { width: calc(100% - 80px); left: 80px !important; }
            .event.left .hex-button, .event.right .hex-button { left: -75px !important; }
            .header h1 { font-size: 2.2em; }
            .nav-links { flex-direction: column; gap: 15px; }
            .participants-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .rolodex-table { font-size: 0.9em; }
            .rolodex-table th, .rolodex-table td { padding: 8px 10px; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="popup-overlay" id="popupOverlay"></div>
    <div class="contact-popup" id="contactPopup">
        <button class="close-btn" onclick="closeContactPopup()">&times;</button>
        <div id="contactContent"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
        <!-- Formal Header -->
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Tallah/Goldie Case Analysis</h1>
            <div class="subtitle">Complete Investigation Documentation & Timeline</div>
            <div class="case-details">September 3-18, 2025 | Service Doberman Suspicious Death Investigation</div>
        </div>

        <!-- Navigation Menu -->
        <div class="nav-menu">
            <h3>Document Sections</h3>
            <div class="nav-links">
                <a href="#timeline" class="nav-link">Incident Timeline</a>
                <a href="#response-analysis" class="nav-link">Response Flow Analysis</a>
                <a href="#escalation" class="nav-link">Escalation Analysis</a>
                <a href="#contact-network" class="nav-link">Contact Network</a>
                <a href="#participants" class="nav-link">Key Participants</a>
                <a href="#rolodex" class="nav-link">Complete Rolodex</a>
                <a href="#strategic-notes" class="nav-link">Strategic Notes</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Timeline Section -->
        <div class="section" id="timeline">
            <div class="section-header">
                <div class="section-title">Chronological Timeline of Events</div>
                <div class="section-description">Detailed sequence of communications and actions from initial incident through legal escalation</div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="timeline">
                <div class="day-section">
                    <div class="day-header">September 3, 2025 - Initial Incident</div>
                    
                    <div class="event left critical" onclick="showContactDetails('dumas', '19:30-20:00 PDT - Dinner & Medication')">
                        <div class="response-indicator response-none"></div>
                        <div class="hex-button">
                            <div class="hex-main"></div>
                            <div class="hex-satellites">
                                <div class="hex-satellite"></div>
                                <div class="hex-satellite"></div>
                                <div class="hex-satellite"></div>
                                <div class="hex-satellite"></div>
                                <div class="hex-satellite"></div>
                                <div class="hex-satellite"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="event-time">19:30-20:00 PDT</div>
                        <div class="event-title">Dinner & Medication Administration</div>
                        <div class="event-description">Extended-release Guaifenesin (1200mg) and Dextromethorphan (60mg) administered. Suspicious food drop documented near known intimidation incidents.
                            <div class="source-citation">Source: 2025-09-06_Timeline_to_NSG.eml, Page 3</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="event right critical" onclick="showContactDetails('dumas', '22:30 PDT - Death Confirmed')">
                        <div class="response-indicator response-negative"></div>
                        <div class="hex-button">
                            <div class="hex-main"></div>
                            <div class="hex-satellites">
                                <div class="hex-satellite"></div>
                                <div class="hex-satellite"></div>
                                <div class="hex-satellite"></div>
                                <div class="hex-satellite"></div>
                                <div class="hex-satellite"></div>
                                <div class="hex-satellite"></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="event-time">22:30 PDT</div>
                        <div class="event-title">Death Confirmed</div>
                        <div class="event-description">Death confirmed despite immediate CPR intervention. Suspected poisoning/homicide based on rapid deterioration pattern.
                            <div class="source-citation">Source: 2025-09-06_Timeline_to_NSG.eml, Page 3</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    
                    <div class="event left communication" onclick="showContactDetails('dumas,ucdavis', '~23:30 PDT - Emergency Preservation Calls')">
                        <div class="response-indicator response-positive"></div>
